TopNav
@atlaskit/navigation-system

Props (6)
  children       string | number | boolean | React.ReactElement<any, string | React.JSXElementConstructor<any>> | It…
  The content of the layout area. Should include `TopNavStart`, `TopNavMiddle`, and `TopNavEnd`.
  customTheme    CustomTheme | undefined
  Custom theme for the top navigation. This is a port of Nav 3 functionality, and not recommended for new usage, as it does not align with our future vision.
  height         number | undefined
  Not intended for long term use. This is added to support the migration to the new page layout. We may replace this prop in a future release.
  id             string | undefined
  The `id` attribute of the slot. Used to connect the layout slot's skip link to the layout element. If not provided, a unique ID will be generated.
  skipLinkLabel  string | undefined
  The label for this slot's skip link. Defaults to the slot's `label` value.
  xcss           false | (XCSSValue<"backgroundColor", DesignTokenStyles, ""> & {} & XCSSPseudo<"backgroundColor", n…
  Bounded style overrides.

